flowchart TD
    subgraph Data Layer
        Loader -->|load_properties| Properties[PropertiesSchema]
        Loader -->|load_configurations| Configurations[ConfigurationSchema]
        Loader -->|load_state| State[StateSchema]
        Properties & Configurations & State --> AppContext[ApplicationContext]
    end

    subgraph Relational Indices
        Properties --> ShorelineIndex[ShorelineIndex.from_properties]
        Configurations --> MaterialIndex[MaterialIndex.from_configuration]
    end

    subgraph Executors & Actuators
        Configurations --> FactoryTranslator[Factory.translator]
        FactoryTranslator --> Executors[Master & Stage Executors]
        Actuator[Actuator]
    end

    subgraph Board & Core Subsystems
        Properties & Configurations & Recipes & MaterialIndex --> Decomposer[Decomposer]
        Properties --> EquipmentGroup[EquipmentGroup]
        EquipmentGroup & Configurations --> Board[Board]
        
        Decomposer & MaterialIndex & Actuator --> Migrator[Migrator]
        Migrator -.->|attached to| Board
        
        SpawnableGroup --> Cradle[Cradle]
        Recipes & MaterialIndex & Decomposer --> Cradle
        Cradle -.->|injected into| Board
        
        Configurations --> Device[Device Instance via Factory.device]
        Device -.->|injected into| Board
    end

    subgraph Registry & Rendering
        Properties & Recipes --> Registry[Registry]
        AppContext --> Render[render.init / subsystem]
    end

    subgraph Pipeline & UI Components
        Board --> Screen[Screen / Layers]
        Registry --> Screen
        
        Executors & MaterialIndex & ShorelineIndex --> Mechanics[Core & World Mechanics via Factory.mechanics]
        
        Configurations --> Library[Library]
        Registry & Library --> Binder[Binder]
        Binder & Fabricator[Fabricator] --> Provider[Provider]
    end

    subgraph Engine Assembly
        Board --> Engine[Engine]
        Screen --> Engine
        Mechanics --> Engine
        Provider --> Engine
    end

    %% Wiring from AppContext / Builder methods
    AppContext --> Board
    AppContext --> Registry
    AppContext --> Render
    ShorelineIndex & MaterialIndex --> Board
    Executors --> Board